From 13251eb1168c28214829bf26249db8e8f0fbd06f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harry Wentland <harry.wentland@amd.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Apr 2026 17:40:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] [FROM-UPSTREAM] drm/amd/display: add HDMI 2.1 DSC over
 FRL support

Add all the bits to enable DSC over FRL.

Signed-off-by: Harry Wentland <harry.wentland@amd.com>
Reviewed-by: Fangzhi Zuo <Jerry.Zuo@amd.com>
